{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. - Search object. - If object found, pick up. - Then check its properties. - And perform specific task. - Otherwise, move and scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickupObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = HasObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
